<title>JAPAN: Union Tool -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Union Tool -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to May 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  5.16		vs	    4.22</p>
<p> Operating	    1.30		vs	  929    million</p>
<p> Current		1.28		vs	  943    million</p>
<p> Net		  644    million	  vs	  493    million</p>
<p> EPS		   33.77 yen	  vs	   27.29 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     19 million	  vs	  18 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  8.00 yen	  vs	    6.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Union Tool Co Ltd is the world&quot;s leading manufacturer of drills used for printed circuit boards.</p>
</text>
